ts in circuits—such as Uad, Ucd, Uab, Ubc, and Uac in filter networks—as well as to analyze transient processes in microdifferentiation and integration circuits. It supports specialized analyses including phase relationship assessment via Lissajous figures and is especially valuable for examining repetitive waveforms, though modified techniques can extend its utility to non-repetitive or single-shot events. Schematic representations frequently depict it as a large rectangular block labeled “示波器” (Chinese for “oscilloscope”) or “到示波器” (“to oscilloscope”), with probes marked “X” and “Y” connected to key circuit junctions such as amplifier outputs and low-pass RC filter networks—emphasizing its role as an external, integrated measurement device. While some references contextualize the ...(truncated)
